              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolakara kapaaran naka aikemer, koomoom da kapaaran naka ican: asubunit Edeke adiopet kwape kanaee, tetere mam etuŋanan enicuni nuetupanakinete ŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
